  "lang": "en",
  "description": [
    "A racemate comprising equimolar amounts of (3<i>R</i>,5<i>S</i>)- and (3<i>S</i>,5<i>R</i>)-fluvastatin. An HMG-CoA reductase inhibitor, it is used (often as the corresponding sodium salt) to reduce triglycerides and LDL-cholesterol, and increase HDL-chloesterol, in the treatment of hyperlipidaemia."
  ],
